 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Advanced Evaluation Metrics for Fine-tuned NeuTTS Model\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook provides a comprehensive framework to evaluate your TTS model using:\n",
    "1.  **MCD (Mel Cepstral Distortion)**: Spectral accuracy.\n",
    "2.  **WER (Word Error Rate)**: Intelligibility via Whisper ASR.\n",
    "3.  **Speaker Similarity**: Voice identity matching using ECAPA-TDNN embeddings.\n",
    "4.  **F0 RMSE**: Pitch contour accuracy.\n",
    "5.  **STOI (Short-Time Objective Intelligibility)**: Objective intelligibility score.\n",
    "6.  **PESQ (Perceptual Evaluation of Speech Quality)**: Objective MOS-like score.\n",
    "7.  **LSD (Log-Spectral Distance)**: Measure of distance between log-spectrograms.\n",
    "8.  **Visualizations**: Loss curves and Spectrogram comparisons."
   ]
  },
